<LegalPage title="Terms — GetMine.ai" description="Short, plain-English terms for using GetMine.ai during closed-beta Early Access." canonical="https://getmine.ai/terms.html">
    <p class="page-eyebrow">Terms</p>
    <h1 class="page-headline">GetMine is available through Early Access.</h1>

    <p class="page-lead">A short, plain-English version of the terms while we build this with our first users. A fuller set will accompany the public launch.</p>

    <div class="page-section">
      <h2>What Early Access means</h2>
      <p>GetMine is in closed beta. Features will evolve, the product will change, and parts of what you see today may look different at launch. We&rsquo;ll tell you when meaningful changes happen.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="page-section">
      <h2>Use responsibly</h2>
      <p>Please use GetMine for personal health information you have the right to use. Don&rsquo;t add information that belongs to someone else without their consent.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="page-section">
      <h2>Not a medical service</h2>
      <p>GetMine is a personal health organisation tool. We are not a doctor, hospital or healthcare provider. We do not provide medical advice, diagnosis or treatment. If you have a health concern, please seek advice from a qualified medical professional.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="page-section">
      <h2>Your account</h2>
      <p>Take reasonable care of your account credentials. Let us know if you think something has gone wrong with your account or vault.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="page-section">
      <h2>If something breaks</h2>
      <p>GetMine is provided as-is during Early Access. We&rsquo;ll do our best to make it work for you and to fix issues quickly, but we can&rsquo;t promise the service will be free of errors while we&rsquo;re still building it.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="page-section">
      <h2>Questions</h2>
      <p>Write to <a href="mailto:hello@getmine.ai">hello@getmine.ai</a> for anything that isn&rsquo;t covered above.</p>
    </div>
</LegalPage>
